cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Basecalling for DNA storage"
version: 1.0.0
license: "MIT"
type: software
abstract: "Code accompanying the paper 'Basecalling for DNA storage'. Includes a PyTorch reimplementation of the SACall basecaller, whole-model, decoder and low-rank adaptation (LoRA) fine-tuning on simulated nanopore signals of Goldman-encoded DNA, a constraint-aware CTC beam search (fork of fast-ctc-decode) using homopolymer, length and base-composition constraints, and the evaluation and statistical analysis scripts."
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
